{
  "name": "Website Lead Intake - Dedupe, Sheet, Welcome Email, Slack",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4cf89640-756b-4aeb-98c2-1f17288678d2",
      "name": "Webhook - Lead Form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-1120, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "website-lead-form",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "website-lead-form"
    },
    {
      "id": "21acbc9c-f1cd-4dd4-bf51-a6e898f03aca",
      "name": "Normalize Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-880, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "email",
              "name": "email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.email ?? $json.email ?? '').toString().trim().toLowerCase() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "firstName",
              "name": "firstName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.firstName ?? $json.firstName ?? '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "lastName",
              "name": "lastName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.lastName ?? $json.lastName ?? '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "company",
              "name": "company",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.company ?? $json.company ?? '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "submittedAt",
              "name": "submittedAt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8512dcb9-32a0-404b-be4a-f90a799e3983",
      "name": "Validate Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-640, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-email",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dc74d185-5b65-4596-96bb-b35b90ba9a67",
      "name": "Google Sheets - Search by Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.6,
      "position": [-400, 200],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "search",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Leads"
        },
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            { "lookupColumn": "email", "lookupValue": "={{ $json.email }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1ccf335d-fa12-4f52-8534-d7dcecc94d42",
      "name": "Is Duplicate?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-160, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "found-existing-row",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bdd75a1f-f04d-4728-a4bd-c70aae495d1e",
      "name": "Mark Duplicate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [80, 80],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "status",
              "name": "status",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "duplicate_skipped"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3ea115c6-b309-41cf-ac07-e2a775e04520",
      "name": "Respond - Duplicate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [320, 80],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"duplicate\", \"message\": \"Lead already processed, skipped.\", \"email\": $json.email } }}",
        "options": { "responseCode": 200 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0faca845-f7a3-4fe7-bda6-d80407c85cd7",
      "name": "Google Sheets - Append Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.6,
      "position": [80, 320],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Leads"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "firstName": "={{ $json.firstName }}",
            "lastName": "={{ $json.lastName }}",
            "company": "={{ $json.company }}",
            "submittedAt": "={{ $json.submittedAt }}",
            "welcomeEmailSent": "false"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8aaa6009-7711-43a0-afbc-3c2531878734",
      "name": "Send Welcome Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [320, 320],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "hello@example.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "Welcome!",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<p>Hi {{ $json.firstName || 'there' }}, thanks for reaching out — we'll be in touch shortly.</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "SMTP account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1bcae73c-701d-4ba1-bb88-5667a12fc1ec",
      "name": "Google Sheets - Mark Email Sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.6,
      "position": [560, 320],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Leads"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": ["email"],
          "value": {
            "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "welcomeEmailSent": "true"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "53a73edb-56f6-4695-a125-53f7e597b614",
      "name": "Slack - Notify Team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [800, 320],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CHANNEL_ID",
          "cachedResultName": "#sales-leads"
        },
        "text": "=New lead: {{ $json.firstName }} {{ $json.lastName }} <{{ $json.email }}> ({{ $json.company }})",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8fab69f7-a380-4841-b179-dbe6255920eb",
      "name": "Respond - Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [1040, 320],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"created\", \"message\": \"Lead processed.\", \"email\": $json.email } }}",
        "options": { "responseCode": 200 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fee5923c-af73-431c-9f78-603702792629",
      "name": "Format Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [80, 600],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "statusCode",
              "name": "statusCode",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.error ? 500 : 400 }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "errorMessage",
              "name": "errorMessage",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.error?.message ?? 'Missing required field: email' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "failedNode",
              "name": "failedNode",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.error?.node?.name ?? 'Validate Email' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "email",
              "name": "email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.email ?? $json.body?.email ?? 'unknown' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9bcae11a-4c8b-43b4-9f2e-805281deb072",
      "name": "Slack - Alert Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [320, 600],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_ALERTS_CHANNEL_ID",
          "cachedResultName": "#alerts"
        },
        "text": "=:rotating_light: Lead workflow failure on node *{{ $json.failedNode }}* for email {{ $json.email }}: {{ $json.errorMessage }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f11ba396-1210-4677-8985-80c5ff226b0a",
      "name": "Respond - Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [560, 600],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"error\", \"message\": $json.errorMessage } }}",
        "options": { "responseCode": "={{ $json.statusCode }}" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fbee3e6a-19fc-45be-b1b1-700a7a12207e",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Verify Before Activation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1120, 600],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## VERIFY BEFORE ACTIVATION (no live instance was available to check this against)\n\n1. Google Sheets node (v4.6): confirm the exact `operation` enum values (`search`/`append`/`update` used here) and parameter keys (`filtersUI`, `columns.matchingColumns`) against the installed n8n version — this node's parameter schema has changed across versions.\n2. Create real credentials in the live instance (Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP or Gmail OAuth2, Slack API) and replace every `REPLACE_WITH_*` id/value here — none of this file's credential fields are usable as-is.\n3. Set the real `documentId`/`sheetName` for the Leads sheet, and create an `email` column + a `welcomeEmailSent` column (boolean) as the header row.\n4. Set the real Slack `channelId` for both #sales-leads and #alerts.\n5. Concurrency/race caveat: Google Sheets has no atomic check-and-insert. Two webhook requests for the same email arriving within the same few seconds could both pass the duplicate search before either appends, causing a double send. Mitigate via n8n queue mode with a concurrency key, or move the dedupe/lock to a store with a real unique constraint (Postgres/Redis) if this risk matters for your traffic.\n6. If a downstream step fails after the row is appended (welcomeEmailSent=false), the lead is now permanently treated as a duplicate on retry and will never receive the welcome email automatically. This is intentional (protects the 'never twice' requirement over auto-retry) — the failure alert is the cue to fix and manually resend/update that row.\n7. Confirm `emailSend` node is the right choice for your mail provider (SMTP) vs swapping for the Gmail/Outlook node with OAuth2 — parameter names differ.\n8. Webhook path `website-lead-form` and workflow being `active: false` are deliberate — set active only after the above is confirmed on the live instance."
      }
    }
  ],
